Updating cluster-scoped resources for shared cluster components (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
Last Updated: 2026-07-15

If the scheduling service is installed on the cluster, you must update the cluster-scoped resources, such as the cluster roles and cluster role bindings, for the scheduling service.

